          "filename": "Border Traffic between Namibia and Angola.jpg",
          "caption": "The fixed border crossing points in the form of bridges over the Okavango River between the two countries are few and far between. Most people who have relatives on either side of the river or do their shopping in Namibia resort to traversing the border by boat, be it motorized or a traditional carved canoe (known as wato, depicted in the distance).",
